TASK CHORE46
	TITLE "the repository security alerts are enabled"
	STATUS todo
	SPEC "The security alerts are enabled in the repository security settings, a gesture left to"
		+ "the user outside the repository, and the API no longer refuses them"
	RATIONALE "The repository security alerts are disabled: the API refuses them, and without them"
		+ "dependency tracking only yields version updates. Vulnerability advisories today appear"
		+ "only in the audit job, on a pull request, never on a schedule. The other way out is to"
		+ "schedule the audit job, which the repository does not do: it runs only on a pull request"
		+ "and on the default branch"
	SOURCE "Observed while checking the weekly Dependabot updates after their merge"
		REF @PULL_REQUEST.PCST53

