	SPEC "each of the five files has a JSON Schema beside it, and bun run validate:tables exits"
		+ "non-zero when a row does not meet it"
	SPEC "each TypeScript module that carried one of those tables imports the JSON file instead of"
		+ "restating its rows, and the tests that read the table pass unchanged"
	SPEC "five DATATABLE entities carry TABLE, KEY and JSON_SCHEMA, and every rule with authority"
		+ "over those values names its table through VALUES_FROM"
	SPEC "the value tables of docs/energy-levels.md and the appendix of docs/save-format.md are"
		+ "deleted, no row surviving in markdown"
	SPEC "a URL or a GAME_RELEASE entity that no SOURCE cites is a lint error, and the workspace"
		+ "lints clean under --strict with that gate in place"
	DESC "orphan sources: WHEN STATUS active carrying INCOMING, on URL and on GAME_RELEASE, under a"
		+ "CONVERSE declared on SOURCE.REF; INCOMING at type level is L023; probed on awawa 2.7.0"
		+ "on a copy of the whole workspace, 2026-09-18: two orphans raise L026, the 275 entities"
		+ "stay clean, and every footer of a source then reads under that CONVERSE instead of"
		+ "referenced by"
	RATIONALE "A DATATABLE requires TABLE and JSON_SCHEMA, two anchors on files git tracks; the"
		+ "tables are TypeScript modules today and neither file exists. Writing the five entities"
		+ "before the task would leave the corpus pointing at nothing, and creating the JSON files"
		+ "without rewiring the modules would give each value two homes until the rewiring lands."
		+ "The step that writes the first entities therefore writes no DATATABLE and this task"
		+ "carries the whole move"
		REF @DECISION.AnAnchorNamesAFileTrackedByGit
